        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2013, we elected to become a business development company (“BDC”) under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (the “1940 Act”).",
        "start_character": 422,
        "end_character": 549
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In transactions involving business borrowers, we will seek to invest in transactions with businesses that have developed, or appear poised to develop, a strong competitive position within their respective industry sector or niche.",
        "start_character": 70355,
        "end_character": 70585
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate within a developing and increasingly competitive segment of the digital asset market, consisting of publicly traded digital asset treasury (“DAT”) companies whose business models provide investors with indirect exposure to digital assets through publicly traded equity securities.",
        "start_character": 76666,
        "end_character": 76957
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of this diverse general experience and particular experience in transactional finance, we believe we are able to manage the evaluation and due-diligence process involved in our investment opportunities swiftly and efficiently, by collaborating with our professional advisers and focusing on high-level and material issues.",
        "start_character": 83945,
        "end_character": 84279
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From our inception until December 13, 2012, we operated as a development-stage company involved in the gaming and entertainment industry.",
        "start_character": 284,
        "end_character": 421
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Nevertheless, we believe we are well positioned to compete successfully in this market because of our entrepreneurial, creative and flexible approach to specialty finance opportunities, and our management’s experience in entrepreneurial ventures and finance.",
        "start_character": 81017,
        "end_character": 81275
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "This overall strategy also contemplates that we may (i) periodically sell SUI for general corporate purposes, including to generate cash for treasury management, acquisitions, or strategies that generate tax benefits in accordance with applicable law, and (ii) pursue strategies to create income streams or otherwise generate funds using our SUI holdings.",
        "start_character": 3159,
        "end_character": 3514
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe we are generally able to charge high interest for our specialty finance solutions because: (i) banks and other traditional providers of credit may have neither the expertise nor the infrastructure needed to evaluate creditworthiness and risks in a timeframe suitable for a potential borrower, preferring instead to process transactions and structures that present few novel issues or risks;",
        "start_character": 65688,
        "end_character": 66089
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We may choose to accept, hold, sell or distribute airdropped assets based on their alignment with our financial objectives, regulatory compliance requirements and operational capabilities, subject to internal governance procedures.",
        "start_character": 8897,
        "end_character": 9128
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In general, we do not believe that we are dependent in any material way on any particular borrower, type of specialty finance transaction, or industry.",
        "start_character": 74749,
        "end_character": 74900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-001672",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-001672-00aaa3b2993c1eb2",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-001672",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
